From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Boris Krasnovskiy <boris.krasnovskiy@ezurio.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: bridge: add independent Lontium drivers

Add independent LT9611C and LT2611UXD bridge drivers. Each driver
privately links the shared LT96xx implementation, so no shared module
lifecycle or exported shared symbols are required.

Signed-off-by: Boris Krasnovskiy <boris.krasnovskiy@ezurio.com>

 Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-lontium-firmware   |   10 +
 .../bindings/display/bridge/lontium,lt2611uxd.yaml |  147 +++
 .../bindings/display/bridge/lontium,lt9611.yaml    |   25 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/Kconfig                     |   29 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/Makefile                    |    4 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/lontium-lt2611uxd.c         |  437 ++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/lontium-lt9611c.c           |  368 ++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/lontium-lt96xx.c            | 1376 ++++++++++++++++++++
